## The vision and stages

**End state:** a London-born, AI-run "digital front office" for small businesses. One emtrc portal covers the website, domain, email, phones, AI receptionist, reviews, local SEO, social and security, for one monthly bill. Claude agents run the pipeline from lead to invoice, and you manage exceptions. Later the same stack is sold white label to other agencies and freelancers, and you buy small agencies' client books to fill it.

A stage starts when the previous gate is met, not on a date.

