**Unit economics behind it:** about £65/mo average revenue per client at 85% gross margin and 2.5% monthly churn gives a lifetime value of about £2,200. That justifies spending up to about £250 to win a client in stage 2. Each add-on raises revenue per client without raising acquisition cost, which is why the bolt-on ladder (Section 4) matters more than adding new clients after stage 2.

