**Postcard engine (stage 2):** the pipeline builds the demo, then the [Stannp API](https://www.stannp.com/uk/pricing) prints and posts an A6 card: "We built \[Business Name\] a website. Scan to see it." The QR opens their own demo with a tracking tag. A scan flags the lead as hot and creates a call task within 24 hours (TPS-checked). Estimated about £0.55 to £0.75 per card \[K\]. Plan on a 3 to 6% scan rate, so 200 cards a month (about £130) should give 6 to 12 scans and 1 to 3 clients. These are assumptions to test.

**AI sales-agent products don't fit.** Artisan, 11x and similar cost about $1,000 to $5,000/mo and need company domains. Build your own with Claude instead: intent feeds → Places enrichment → scoring → demo build → postcard → CRM task → personalised call script.

